wireshark
tshark
tcpdump
nmap
ndiff
arp-scan
netcat-openbsd
dnsutils
curl
wget
openssh-client
socat
# Auto-Kopplung Smartphone <-> Stick (DHCP-Server / Link-Local, kein DHCP noetig)
